{"c":[{"name":"20261002T114801Z-431742a743596ba6","text":"Fill recency: take the just-left window from focus history (the window before the form's last focus), not the latest focus; latest-focus made Jev answer none on most fields once the user moved to another form.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T130715Z-7922f91e68f9ff52","text":"caret-fixture spawned from the frontmost app (T3 or a terminal) became the active app and held the foreground for a whole run; it now deactivates on becoming active. Poll lsappinfo front during GUI runs.","type":"note"}]}
